ts makes them more  visually recognizable and you instantly  know their affiliation overall I still  really adore episode 6 despite the  pacing being pretty fast I think the  show does do a good job to combat that  feeling of a fast pace by having really  long and intriguing dialogue scenes so  we aren't rapidly moving between scenes  if they were able to make a happy  compromise with that and not skipping so  much time then I think the pace would be  perfect thank you for watching and I'm  about to be hit by a hurricane so  hopefully I don't die or lose power for  a long time and I can still make videos  but regardless let me know in the  comments what you thought about episode  6. foreign

